      "en": "The lot of the tribe of the children of Benjamin came up according to their families. The border of their lot went out between the children of Judah and the children of Joseph.",
      "ko": "베냐민 자손 지파를 위하여 그 가족대로 제비를 뽑았으니 그 제비 뽑은 땅의 경계는 유다 자손과 요셉 자손의 중간이라",
      "source_text_hash": "09bfc249d75e33c1968e8a92f9ff58a5662bf5e9854f76b0bd37bfcf43487b58",
      "translation_text_hash": "41926fa38be273ef716d4c2c5b23263e0c377314ee838b536f4215772f24987c",
